      "reason": "PR #88 (D-22-9) adds FrameContact::facing, the eight-way sprite sector a contact's plot presents (facing_band_seen), and compares it in FrameContact::same_as. frames_per_pulse_mean is the mean count of changed frames per pulse (Frame::same_as decides whether a pilot is sent one), so a contact crossing a 45-degree sector inside one armour quadrant now sends a fresh frame, which the cockpit's diagonal sprite needs: 21.25 to 21.292. Every other deterministic field and every minds block (stock_ci, stock_authored, fill_authored, ceiling_authored) is equal at main bfd8af44 on this Linux run.",
